<mxCell id="c26" value="“Memory-bound” is two complaints: bandwidth-bound (weights fit, wait on bytes/s) vs capacity-bound (they do not fit). A faster pipe does nothing for a model that does not load; quantizing or splitting answers capacity." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="360" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
