<mxCell id="k22" value="Hierarchy: registers / shared memory → 50 MB L2 → HBM → host over PCIe, with NVLink (900 GB/s, bidirectional) between GPUs. The L2 holds a tile, not a model — the weights are reread from HBM every token. A measured rate above the roof of the link you use is an accounting error." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="312" width="820" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
